 config/release.json                              |   2 +-
 .../7.3/0029-spi-geni-gpi-dma-deep-idle.patch    | Bin 0 -> 4523 bytes
 patches/linux/7.3/series.json                    |  12 ++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 patches/linux/7.3/0029-spi-geni-gpi-dma-deep-idle.patch

